        "id": "A1",
        "predicate": "findings/P3-storage-context.md (`p3-adapter-receipts/1`) plus exact source/test delta or hash-qualified no-delta; archived commands/log/environment receipts. All named local conformance cases PASS, accepted mode/protected adoption explicit; no supported production label on fixture-only implementation. P9 installed contract and P10 pending list remain separate.",
